    "snippet": "- Mostly quiet weather conditions are expected for the first half of the week, then chances for thunderstorms increase across Central and Eastern Arizona during the latter half of the week. The Desert SW sits between these two features with a feint stream of upper level moisture being advected into the western lower deserts resulting in a few light showers/virga early this morning and lingering upper level clouds.",
